    { "type": "text", "id": "path_t", "x": 1722, "y": 188, "width": 656, "height": 164,
      "text": "StepPath is the real hierarchy\n\nThe nesting above is not in the events as a parent\nid  -  it is encoded in StepPath:\n\n  Refine/Iter_2/Draft\n  FetchAll/FetchUserStep\n\nTo build a tree in a UI, split the path. There is no\nparent-event field to follow.",
      "originalText": "StepPath is the real hierarchy\n\nThe nesting above is not in the events as a parent\nid  -  it is encoded in StepPath:\n\n  Refine/Iter_2/Draft\n  FetchAll/FetchUserStep\n\nTo build a tree in a UI, split the path. There is no\nparent-event field to follow.",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
