    { "type": "text", "id": "dead_t", "x": 1722, "y": 418, "width": 656, "height": 174,
      "text": "Declared, but never emitted\n\n  step.progress\n  step.cached_hit\n  pipeline.resuming\n  pipeline.resumed\n\nThe types exist and you can subscribe to them.\nNothing will ever arrive. Do not build a resume UI\non the last two.",
      "originalText": "Declared, but never emitted\n\n  step.progress\n  step.cached_hit\n  pipeline.resuming\n  pipeline.resumed\n\nThe types exist and you can subscribe to them.\nNothing will ever arrive. Do not build a resume UI\non the last two.",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
